# Keep the build context to what the Dockerfile actually copies: entrypoint.sh,
# snapserver.conf and panel/. The Snapcast .deb packages are fetched from the
# upstream GitHub release in stage 0, and utils/ alone is ~10 MB of tarballs
# that were being uploaded to the builder on every build.
.git
.github
utils
tests
*.md
LICENSE
docker-compose*.yml
docker-compose*.yaml
JBL-fix.sh
ubuntu-pipewire-install-on-host.sh
**/__pycache__
